WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Hundreds, tens and ones

2
00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:09.967
Today we play with big numbers. When ten tens come together, they make one hundred.

3
00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:15.000
Ten tens make one hundred.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.633
Here are two hundreds, four tens and five ones.

5
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:22.267
Two hundred, forty and five.

6
00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:26.200
The number is two hundred forty-five.
